            "sid": "NAM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan worra Ashuru akana jed'e: Worri deebie ilmaani ind'alu, tanaafi maqaani worraa imbada. Anini waan worri harkaani boch'e mid'aasu, ka mana waaqoota worraa keesa jiru, ka worri kad'atu, imballeesa. Anini worra Ashuruti awaala qotuu jira — worri jiraachu himmalle!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
