              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Me ilaala, nami ergaani d'ufu, ka odu dansa ta nagaya namati odeesu, gaareeni ira gad'ufuu jira! Worra Yuda, jila teesani tolfad'a, kakhu isani Waaqati kakhattani guuta. Worri ch'ubbu qabu suni deebie lafa teesani inhad'u; ya worra balleesani fit'ani!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
